                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Speech of Prince Chung at the dedication of the von
                        Ketteler monument.</hi></head>
                <p>The monument erected to the memory of the late Imperial German minister, Baron
                    von Ketteler, stands before us. By order of His Imperial Majesty I have poured
                    out the libations and have inaugurated therewith formally this monument.</p>
                <p>My sovereign wishes this monument to be a warning to the people, a token of the
                    friendship existing between our two nations, and a sign of the blessings which
                    general peace bestows.</p>
                <p>May the name of the deceased Baron von Ketteler remain lasting for all times,
                    like the stately monument before us; that is my sincere wish.</p>
            </div>
